WEBVTT

00:22.040 --> 00:23.680
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>

00:23.880 --> 00:28.630
I LOOKED AT THE BLOOMING
FLOWERS IN MY SHINING DREAM

00:28.800 --> 00:32.350
<i>NO MORE LIFE</i>
I WAS OBSESSED

00:35.280 --> 00:38.670
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY THOSE HANDS

00:38.840 --> 00:41.990
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
I WAS CALLED

00:42.160 --> 00:45.310
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY A LIGHT SHINING

00:45.480 --> 00:48.710
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
IN THE DARKNESS

00:48.880 --> 00:52.320
<i>ONE MORE TIME</i>
IN THE TWINKLING LIGHT

00:52.480 --> 00:55.440
WATCH THAT FIGURE FADE AWAY

00:55.600 --> 00:59.230
<i>NO MORE LIFE</i>
I WAS LEFT BEHIND

00:59.400 --> 01:02.150
BUT TOMORROW WE'LL MEET AGAIN

01:02.320 --> 01:05.440
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY THOSE HANDS

01:05.600 --> 01:08.750
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
I WAS CALLED

01:08.920 --> 01:12.150
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
BY A LIGHT SHINING

01:12.320 --> 01:15.470
<i>JEALOUS</i>, <i>JEALOUS</i>
IN THE DARKNESS

01:15.640 --> 01:21.400
SURROUNDED BY THE LIGHT

01:21.560 --> 01:23.840
<i>DON'T CLOSE EYES
HELP ME</i>

01:24.000 --> 01:29.330
WHEN I SCREAM
<i>WILL BE SATISFACTION, YOU KNOW</i>

01:28.610 --> 01:29.730
KNOW

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with
thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various
daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking
to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:09.980
On the fifteenth day of the
ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:09.980 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of
Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi
clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of
Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been three
hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:47.250 --> 02:49.970
THE ANNIHILATION

02:47.250 --> 02:49.970
OF THE AYAKASHI

03:08.440 --> 03:10.480
It's only birds, Ronin.

03:11.120 --> 03:12.600
Thanks for keeping watch.

03:13.360 --> 03:14.950
It's the role of a ninja.

03:15.640 --> 03:16.840
The artifacts?

03:19.000 --> 03:20.400
They are both safe.

03:20.840 --> 03:26.070
Traveling with a treasure is
more boring than I imagined.

03:26.480 --> 03:29.550
Our concern is not shared.

03:44.360 --> 03:45.560
Yes.

03:50.280 --> 03:54.190
Well, now we need to
look for the third artifact.

03:54.480 --> 03:57.630
No, Musashi, it will be the fourth.

03:58.120 --> 03:59.390
What do you mean?

04:00.080 --> 04:03.870
It seems that Kaguya has
obtained the third artifact.

04:21.160 --> 04:22.430
It's true.

04:23.560 --> 04:27.030
She got it after I left the other time-space!

04:27.400 --> 04:29.760
The princess is doing fine!

04:31.520 --> 04:33.160
Four remain.

04:34.440 --> 04:37.830
How do you know Kaguya took the third one?

04:39.280 --> 04:40.550
Did you see it in a dream?

04:40.920 --> 04:43.390
Ruko told me.

04:45.480 --> 04:47.310
Ruko?

04:47.480 --> 04:51.950
Would that be the bird that
often flies over your head?

04:53.000 --> 04:59.200
According to Ruko, Kaguya is
now heading toward Kyushu.

04:59.400 --> 05:03.000
I understand, Kaguya and the
others are also doing well.

05:03.160 --> 05:05.360
We have to try harder.

05:05.520 --> 05:08.960
I will be the one to get the fourth artifact!

05:12.880 --> 05:16.840
In the end, Sasuke Sarutobi did not return.

05:18.160 --> 05:20.230
I hope he is okay.

05:20.680 --> 05:22.640
Don't worry about him.

05:23.720 --> 05:27.270
Do you know what happened to Sasuke Sarutobi?

05:28.080 --> 05:33.840
He merged with his future duplicate after
disappearing into the other time-space.

05:34.040 --> 05:35.520
His future duplicate?

05:36.000 --> 05:40.470
It must be a certain Ninjataro
who is the same as him.

05:41.120 --> 05:47.310
Ninjataro and Sasuke Sarutobi were
therefore one and the same person.

05:48.200 --> 05:52.110
Does that mean one person split into two?

05:52.280 --> 05:54.000
Is that possible?

05:54.760 --> 06:00.840
My first fight with Yasha caused
a distortion in space-time.

06:01.000 --> 06:06.750
Sarutobi, probably on our wavelength, was transported to a parallel space-time.

06:08.080 --> 06:15.920
When I lost to Yasha, I was forced
to separate my spirit from my body.

06:35.440 --> 06:42.270
This energy may have affected
Sarutobi, splitting him into two.

06:43.440 --> 06:47.070
I see, it is both comprehensible
and incomprehensible.

06:47.280 --> 06:50.080
But it is a convincing theory.

06:51.080 --> 06:52.590
And yesterday...

06:53.000 --> 06:57.550
I fought Yasha and won in
this different space-time...

06:58.360 --> 07:01.190
and I was able to recover my body.

07:56.000 --> 08:02.870
This caused Ninjataro and
Sasuke Sarutobi to merge.

08:06.000 --> 08:09.680
But then, where is Sasuke Sarutobi?

08:10.360 --> 08:14.910
Probably with Musashi and his companions.

08:15.520 --> 08:20.360
As Sasuke Sarutobi or as Ninjataro?

08:21.080 --> 08:22.590
Useless question.

08:23.000 --> 08:27.790
Both constitute one person.

08:28.840 --> 08:32.390
I see, it is both comprehensible
and incomprehensible.

08:35.280 --> 08:36.480
What is it?

08:37.360 --> 08:42.070
Can you continue without me for a while?

08:42.680 --> 08:44.880
Where are you going, Urashima?

08:45.840 --> 08:47.880
I am going to annihilate the ayakashi.

08:48.840 --> 08:50.320
Meaning...

08:50.480 --> 08:53.040
Are you going towards the ayakashi's castle?

08:53.880 --> 08:55.710
First to Edo Castle.

08:56.360 --> 08:57.560
Alone?

08:58.320 --> 09:01.550
Now that Yasha is gone, the time has come.

09:02.800 --> 09:04.470
I must leave now.

09:04.640 --> 09:05.990
Be careful.

09:23.200 --> 09:24.400
He is not here.

09:24.880 --> 09:26.280
He is not here.

09:27.640 --> 09:29.310
Not here either.

09:31.880 --> 09:34.920
Yasha!
Where are you?

09:37.640 --> 09:38.870
My little Yasha?

09:39.880 --> 09:41.840
Show yourself, little Yasha!

09:44.600 --> 09:46.800
Where are you, little Yasha?

09:52.600 --> 09:54.990
Do you know where Yasha is?

09:55.480 --> 09:57.630
I actually haven't seen him.

09:58.120 --> 10:03.240
Usually, that scoundrel shows
up as soon as I call him.

10:04.000 --> 10:06.200
Did something happen to him?

10:06.680 --> 10:09.400
Certainly not!

10:09.560 --> 10:12.840
After all, he is an invincible ayakashi!

10:13.320 --> 10:19.470
Yet, so many ayakashi
were killed by Musashi.

10:20.080 --> 10:22.880
But Yasha is no ordinary ayakashi!

10:23.600 --> 10:24.800
That is true.

10:26.400 --> 10:28.630
Why are you laughing?

10:29.320 --> 10:31.360
Nothing.

10:31.760 --> 10:37.640
You talk Yasha down a lot,
but deep down you admire him.

10:37.840 --> 10:39.750
What are you talking about?

10:40.200 --> 10:41.710
Don't be embarrassed.

10:42.640 --> 10:43.990
I am not embarrassed.

10:47.080 --> 10:48.990
A space-time distortion!

10:50.520 --> 10:54.430
That happens when Yasha "telecourts".

10:54.640 --> 10:56.840
It is "teleports"!

10:57.400 --> 11:02.800
Avoid using foreign words you don't understand.

11:03.320 --> 11:05.600
My ears are ringing.

11:05.760 --> 11:09.440
Silence!
Whatever, Yasha is back!

11:17.800 --> 11:19.790
You again?
Who are you?

11:20.560 --> 11:23.070
Urashima, the Yin-Yang monk.

11:24.080 --> 11:26.750
Thank you for remembering.

11:26.920 --> 11:29.070
It wasn't Yasha, Ryogen.

11:29.720 --> 11:33.030
But like Yasha, he "telecourts"...

11:33.720 --> 11:35.280
Teleports!

11:35.480 --> 11:40.240
Exactly!
He moves instantaneously.

11:42.800 --> 11:45.680
Urashima or whatever you are,
do you know where Yasha is?

11:46.120 --> 11:49.670
I have been looking for him for a while.

11:50.440 --> 11:52.950
Yasha is no longer in this world.

11:53.400 --> 11:54.720
Impossible!

11:55.440 --> 11:56.670
He's dead?

11:56.880 --> 12:01.160
Originally, Yasha did not exist.

12:01.880 --> 12:04.320
Everything is back as it was before, nothing more.

12:04.600 --> 12:08.280
What are you talking about?
I don't understand a damn thing!

12:08.680 --> 12:09.910
Urashima...

12:10.560 --> 12:11.760
Yes?

12:11.880 --> 12:13.920
Is Yasha really dead?

12:14.320 --> 12:17.230
To say that he is dead is not accurate.

12:17.400 --> 12:19.680
He stopped "existing".

12:19.880 --> 12:21.920
That means he is dead!

12:22.360 --> 12:24.080
Are you the one who killed him?

12:24.280 --> 12:29.880
If you mean that I made him cease to exist, yes.

12:30.920 --> 12:36.800
What does that mean? If Yasha is
dead, what about my ambitions?

12:36.960 --> 12:40.160
I even agreed to become this monster...

12:40.320 --> 12:45.960
What about my ambition, my
dream of the Tokugawa shogunate?

12:47.400 --> 12:50.790
What good did becoming
an ayakashi do to me?

12:50.960 --> 12:57.880
I sold out to the ayakashi because
I believed they could change history!

12:59.480 --> 13:04.030
What should I do now?

13:05.120 --> 13:09.640
Should I spend the rest of my
days in this hideous body?

13:11.080 --> 13:13.960
What should I do?

13:14.720 --> 13:18.080
If living seems hard,
why not choose to die?

13:20.520 --> 13:22.480
I will kill you.

13:34.040 --> 13:36.080
Wait!
Wait a minute!

13:36.560 --> 13:41.880
Before killing you, I want to tell you
something good about your future.

13:42.560 --> 13:45.710
Something good about my future?

13:45.880 --> 13:47.520
Am I going to win at the lotto?

13:48.440 --> 13:53.470
I hate people who don't know when to shut up.

13:55.040 --> 13:59.480
Wait! Pretend I didn't say anything!
Can't you just let it slide?

14:00.200 --> 14:04.430
Soon, history will resume its authentic course.

14:04.880 --> 14:06.870
The Toyotomi shogunate...

14:07.040 --> 14:13.080
is about to collapse and the Tokugawa
will unify and restore the country.

14:13.920 --> 14:17.040
What, is that the truth?

14:17.240 --> 14:21.790
The disappearance of Yasha,
my new materiality...

14:21.960 --> 14:27.750
everything is due to the correction
of the distortion of our space-time.

14:29.320 --> 14:34.950
Ryogen, congratulations.
Your dream will come true.

14:35.120 --> 14:37.000
You can die in peace.

14:37.520 --> 14:43.150
Wait a minute, it doesn't make sense!
If I die, I lose everything, right?

14:44.040 --> 14:48.000
Probably, but your death will not be in vain.

14:48.160 --> 14:49.990
That's what it means.

14:50.520 --> 14:52.720
Bad answer!

14:55.840 --> 14:58.200
You won't stop me?

14:59.520 --> 15:00.840
You want me to stop you?

15:04.880 --> 15:08.840
You're not really going to kill him, are you?

15:10.960 --> 15:12.470
Urashima...

15:14.000 --> 15:16.280
What are you thinking?

15:19.560 --> 15:21.550
Help me!

15:22.320 --> 15:26.150
You are the brilliant inventor Leonardo da Vinci.

15:26.600 --> 15:29.350
You read my mind.

15:30.200 --> 15:33.560
I don't know you very well...

15:33.720 --> 15:39.750
but if I compare you to Yasha,
I can understand your way of thinking.

15:39.920 --> 15:41.120
I understand.

15:42.960 --> 15:44.870
Lord Shingen, are you there?

15:45.040 --> 15:47.110
It's me, leyasu!

15:47.280 --> 15:50.400
I need your help, Shingen!

15:52.480 --> 15:55.230
Shingen, there you are!

15:57.280 --> 15:58.630
Lord Shingen!

15:58.800 --> 16:02.710
Please, great warlord!

16:03.800 --> 16:07.680
Kill the Yin-Yang monk Urashima now!

16:08.400 --> 16:12.440
He wants to kill me!

16:13.080 --> 16:14.910
I beg of you!

16:18.400 --> 16:20.520
Lord Shingen!

16:31.160 --> 16:36.990
I only wish to imprison all the
ayakashi of this world, nothing more.

16:37.800 --> 16:41.510
Good pretext, but what
are you real intentions?

16:41.960 --> 16:43.790
I don't play a double game.

16:44.520 --> 16:46.240
Is that really true?

16:47.160 --> 16:49.200
Shingen...

16:49.720 --> 16:50.920
Shingen, he...

16:51.440 --> 16:53.080
What's up with Shingen Takeda?

16:53.680 --> 16:54.880
He melted!

16:55.640 --> 16:58.680
He has already died of stomach cancer.

16:59.360 --> 17:01.640
There is nothing left but slime!

17:02.520 --> 17:07.150
It was originally a dead soul and
an ayakashi merged together.

17:07.320 --> 17:09.600
He did not belong to this world.

17:09.800 --> 17:12.360
Whatever, he is dead!

17:13.120 --> 17:15.950
In plain words, he ceased to exist.

17:16.120 --> 17:17.320
That's it!

17:17.960 --> 17:20.080
Did you do that?

17:20.520 --> 17:22.560
There is nothing to be surprised about.

17:23.120 --> 17:27.510
I got rid of him before I came here.

17:32.960 --> 17:36.160
What, you killed him instantly?

17:36.680 --> 17:39.120
What are you intentions?

17:39.600 --> 17:42.270
How many times do I have to repeat it?

17:44.080 --> 17:48.360
You said you didn't
want to kill me! Liar!

17:49.000 --> 17:52.600
Ryogen, I won't kill you.

17:54.120 --> 17:55.350
I'm not okay with that!

17:55.920 --> 17:59.840
That's not my role, but somebody else's.

18:00.480 --> 18:03.470
Somebody else? Who?

18:03.680 --> 18:05.670
Musashi Miyamoto.

18:09.760 --> 18:14.470
You want Musashi to kill Ryogen? Why?

18:14.640 --> 18:15.910
You will see.

18:18.720 --> 18:20.710
Urashima...

18:26.360 --> 18:28.430
I am getting hungry.

18:28.920 --> 18:32.990
All you talk about is food.

18:33.160 --> 18:35.800
I am, in fact, bored.

18:36.320 --> 18:39.230
Sasuke, do you have the artifacts?

18:40.400 --> 18:41.800
I have them.

18:45.840 --> 18:47.040
The artifacts...

18:47.480 --> 18:49.310
They are glowing!

18:49.880 --> 18:52.080
Sasuke, did you do something?

18:52.560 --> 18:54.150
I didn't do anything!

18:54.920 --> 18:56.560
Why are they glowing?

19:02.040 --> 19:03.240
Musashi!

19:04.520 --> 19:05.720
What?

19:06.320 --> 19:08.990
Your body is also glowing!

19:09.960 --> 19:11.160
Really?

19:14.160 --> 19:15.640
Drop the artifacts!

19:16.120 --> 19:17.680
Why?

19:19.080 --> 19:20.280
Musashi!

19:20.400 --> 19:21.600
He disappeared!

19:21.960 --> 19:23.000
Yes.

19:23.000 --> 19:27.310
It looked like Yasha and Urashima's
instantaneous movements.

19:27.600 --> 19:28.800
Yes.

19:29.440 --> 19:30.710
Musashi...

19:37.600 --> 19:39.640
Here we go again.

19:48.040 --> 19:51.720
If I remember correctly,
you are the monk Urashima.

19:52.280 --> 19:53.480
Yes.

19:54.320 --> 19:57.440
Does that mean I have to face you?

19:58.160 --> 20:03.150
I have no reason to fight you,
but if you insist, I accept.

20:03.840 --> 20:05.880
Because it sounds like fun to me.

20:06.040 --> 20:08.870
You will not face me.

20:09.720 --> 20:10.920
Who then?

20:11.360 --> 20:13.870
The leader of the ayakashi, Ryogen.

20:14.560 --> 20:16.840
He's leyasu Tokugawa, isn't he?

20:17.040 --> 20:18.920
Yes.

20:19.080 --> 20:22.520
I want you to kill him with your own hands.

20:23.000 --> 20:27.120
That doesn't suit me.
Killing is against my principles.

20:27.800 --> 20:30.870
He is already an ayakashi, he is not a man.

20:31.880 --> 20:33.150
Yes, it is true.

20:33.320 --> 20:35.440
Do you accept it?

20:35.880 --> 20:42.560
In fact, I heard Yume say that
you had confronted Yasha.

20:43.080 --> 20:44.310
That's true.

20:44.880 --> 20:46.150
Who won?

20:46.640 --> 20:51.110
The mere fact that I am here
answers your question.

20:53.040 --> 20:55.840
You beat Yasha, you are strong.

20:56.040 --> 20:57.790
Not really.

20:58.000 --> 21:04.600
And also modest! If you're so strong,
why don't you kill Ryogen yourself?

21:05.080 --> 21:07.550
It's important that you are the one to kill him.

21:09.520 --> 21:16.800
You are the savior of this world who will
allow the false history to be corrected.

21:16.960 --> 21:20.560
- Excuse me?
- Anyway, kill Ryogen.

21:20.720 --> 21:23.190
Then the future will change.

21:28.600 --> 21:30.990
Were you leyasu Tokugawa?

21:31.560 --> 21:33.760
That a fact, intact and compact.

21:34.160 --> 21:35.720
Stupid word plays...

21:36.520 --> 21:40.640
Urashima! Where are we?
Who is this little boy?

21:40.960 --> 21:47.240
A parallel world where men and ayakashi
can face each other without restraint.

21:48.160 --> 21:52.150
And that is Musashi Miyamoto.

21:52.800 --> 21:56.160
Good morning, very nice to meet you, etc.

21:56.640 --> 22:00.680
Is that you, Musashi?
See you later for sushi.

22:02.760 --> 22:06.120
Didn't you get the pun?

22:06.280 --> 22:09.110
"Musashi", "sushi", got it?

22:10.440 --> 22:15.070
Urashima, do I really have to kill this old man?

22:16.640 --> 22:19.080
Kill me? Me?

22:19.840 --> 22:23.280
Ryogen, if you want to live,
you must kill Musashi.

22:23.880 --> 22:27.560
If you succeed, I will vouch for your life.

22:28.400 --> 22:34.560
Musashi, for the peace of
the world, kill Ryogen.

22:34.920 --> 22:36.240
That doesn't suit me.

22:36.760 --> 22:37.960
Why?

22:38.320 --> 22:43.710
I have no reason to kill him
and it would do me no good.

22:44.320 --> 22:47.360
- Everything could go back to normal...
- What?

22:47.760 --> 22:50.120
The second demon gun.

22:52.280 --> 22:59.040
I know where the heaven gun is,
the one you are looking for.

22:59.240 --> 23:00.510
Really?

23:00.720 --> 23:08.470
If you agree to help me imprison the ayakashi, I will tell you where it is.

23:10.640 --> 23:17.870
What will you do? Without the heaven gun,
you will end up becoming a demon.

23:19.800 --> 23:21.240
Guess that's it...

23:23.000 --> 23:27.840
I really don't want to, but if I
can avoid becoming a demon...

23:28.520 --> 23:29.720
Ryogen!

23:30.440 --> 23:33.430
I have nothing against you,
but you must die here!

23:33.960 --> 23:35.870
But why?

23:36.080 --> 23:38.990
Poor old man...

24:23.440 --> 24:25.190
MAKE HASTE

24:25.360 --> 24:27.160
THROUGH THE CROWDS

24:27.320 --> 24:31.080
THEY'RE CUTTING OFF YOUR ESCAPE

24:31.240 --> 24:34.950
IN THIS TWILIGHT TOWN
I HEAR PIERCING SOUNDS

24:35.120 --> 24:38.880
LIKE A WANDERING CAT

24:39.040 --> 24:40.790
WITHOUT KNOWING

24:40.960 --> 24:42.760
WHERE TO GO

24:42.920 --> 24:46.680
I'M TRAPPED IN THIS TOWN THAT NEVER SLEEPS

24:46.840 --> 24:50.360
MY REFLECTION IN THE MIRROR

24:50.520 --> 24:55.200
SEEING MYSELF TRANSFORM

24:55.360 --> 24:57.720
I'M HOLDING ON

24:57.880 --> 25:01.160
FOR AS LONG AS POSSIBLE

25:03.200 --> 25:07.830
I'LL SHOW YOU THAT I CAN

25:08.000 --> 25:10.560
WIN OVER THIS TOWN

25:11.720 --> 25:13.760
FROM MY BURNING HEART

25:13.920 --> 25:15.910
SHINE SO MANY

25:16.080 --> 25:19.870
DAZZLING COLORS AND LIGHTS

25:20.040 --> 25:21.550
FLOODING ALL OVER

25:21.720 --> 25:23.710
SCATTERING ALL OVER

25:27.200 --> 25:29.650
SOLEMNLY

25:32.120 --> 25:36.920
As I fight Ryogen, will Ronin
and Kaguya kill each other?

25:37.120 --> 25:38.320
Why?

25:38.760 --> 25:41.610
The next chapter: <i>Simultaneously Striking Each Other!</i>
